The Associate of Science (AS) degree in General Studies and the Uniform Certificate of General Studies are designed to prepare students for university transfer.

**Program Chair**: Hannah Vaughn • [hvaughn@vhcc.edu](mailto:hvaughn@vhcc.edu) • 276-739-2524

